::GEO_U02_L07_GP_Q05::
Question ID:<br>GEO_U02_L07_GP_Q05<br><br>MLA Standard:<br>MLA.GEO.CGM.6<br><br>Question:<br>Which transformation sequence can justify congruence? {
= Translate, then reflect#Correct. Translate, then reflect matches the evidence and the MLA standard for this item.
~ Dilate by 2, then translate#This choice reflects a misconception: Dilate by 2, then translate. Recheck the evidence and apply the lesson concept before choosing.
~ Stretch, then rotate#This choice reflects a misconception: Stretch, then rotate. Recheck the evidence and apply the lesson concept before choosing.
~ Compress, then reflect#This choice reflects a misconception: Compress, then reflect. Recheck the evidence and apply the lesson concept before choosing.
}
